OL,3,GNEWSAWoman treated in hospital after
OL,4,Ahit-and-run collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman in her 50s has been treated in
OL,7,Fhospital for her injuries after she was
OL,8,Fwas struck by a white Ford Transit van
OL,9,Fthat also collided with another vehicle
OL,10,Fnearby, in a hit-and-run road traffic
OL,11,Fcollision.
OL,13,FPolice said the incident happened at
OL,14,Fabout 18:30 BST on Saturday in the
OL,15,FQueens Quay area of Londonderry.
OL,17,FThey added that the woman's injuries
OL,18,Fare "not believed to be serious at this
OL,19,Ftime".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
