OL,3,GNEWSAWoman treated in hospital after
OL,4,Ahit-and-run collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice later received a report at about
OL,7,F22:10 BST on Saturday that a van had
OL,8,Fbeen found burnt out in the Sheriff's
OL,9,FRoad area of Derry. They believe this
OL,10,Fvehicle "was involved in the earlier
OL,11,Fhit-and-run collision".
